{'symbol': 'PPG', 'date': '2021-09-01 13:04:00', 'title': 'PPG LAUNCHES VIRTUAL PPG AEROSPACE ACADEMY EDUCATION PROGRAM', 'text': "SYLMAR, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PPG (NYSE:PPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS LAUNCHED PPG AEROSPACE ACADEMY ONLINE, WHICH IS A VIRTUAL TRAINING PROGRAM THAT PROVIDES USERS OF THE COMPANY'S AEROSPACE PRODUCTS WITH ON-DEMAND ACCESS TO ONLINE LEARNING MODULES AND RESOURCES. NINE COATINGS-RELATED COURSES ARE AVAILABLE IMMEDIATELY AND COVER A RANGE OF TOPICS, FROM THE BASICS OF SURFACE PREPARATION AND PRIMING THROUGH CUTTING-EDGE TECHNOLOGY LIKE BASECOAT/CLEARCOAT SYSTEMS AND PPG AEROCRON™ ELECTROCOA"}